WEBVTT

00:00:29.671 --> 00:00:32.404
koju sam nazvala "Problemi življenja".

00:00:32.428 --> 00:00:35.833
Dakle, dobijem taj e-mail,
dobijem mnogo ovakvih e-maila,

00:00:35.857 --> 00:00:37.909
i želim vas uvesti u svoj svijet
na trenutak

00:00:37.909 --> 00:00:40.468
i pročitati vam jedno od ovih pisama.

00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:42.026
Evo kako ide.

00:00:46.698 --> 00:00:48.475
"Dragi terapeutu,

00:00:48.499 --> 00:00:49.936
udana sam 10 godina

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.642
i stvari su išle dobro do prije
nekoliko godina.

00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:55.247
Moj muž više nije htio sex
toliko često,

00:00:55.271 --> 00:00:57.310
a sada jedva da ga i ima."

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:59.349
Vjerujem kako ovo niste očekivali.

00:00:59.373 --> 00:01:00.374
(Smijeh)